  <item>
    <title>017.河森堡×法医秦明：法医是守护生命最后尊严的职业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61caf7e9467c31d43b703604</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61caf7e9467c31d43b703604</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Dec 2021 11:41:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>📒｜本期剧透｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 我希望把对法医的歧视和嫌弃，都变为尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 法医的实际工作是什么样的：命案，伤情鉴定，以及非正常死亡现场初勘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a>《尸语者》：法医如何在非正常死亡中鉴定命案？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a>《玩偶》：处理家暴不只是警方的事情，更需要受害人的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 法医技术创新：成人活体年龄推断</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 法医技术创新：虚拟解剖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 尸蜡化、巨人观……解剖时的气味如何面对？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 法医可以转行当医生吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 女性可以当法医吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> 法医的工作强度到底有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> 法医秦明新书《燃烧的蜂鸟》首次官宣！</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖｜推荐阅读｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>法医秦明《玩偶》</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵｜本期配乐｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《法医秦明》电视原声带</span></p><span></span><p><span>《非自然死亡》电视原声带</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂｜收听提示｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>由于本期节目为远程连麦直播转录，音质损伤较大，建议收听过程中降低音量、原倍速收听。多谢诸位！</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔧｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容编辑/后期制作：Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📮｜关注我们｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></p>]]></description>
