  <item>
    <title>015.河森堡×古典：职业规划并非玄学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61971b7a5cc95c0876bb99ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61971b7a5cc95c0876bb99ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Nov 2021 03:35:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>“自由等于能力减欲望”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>“成功不是一系列努力，而是一系列选择”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>“这个时代的游戏规则不是‘超级玛丽’，而是‘我的世界’”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>&nbsp;</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>古典，中国职业规划与个人发展专家，畅销书《跃迁》《拆掉思维里的墙》作者</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 什么是mental model 思维里的墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> “好学生”=高级打工仔，“差等生”=老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 成年人更需要的是自我教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 有意思比有意义更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 幸福不是目标，而是过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> 职业规划没法拯救人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 职业规划师的职业至暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 自由=能力-欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 感到焦虑、自我怀疑怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 这个时代的游戏规则不是“超级玛丽”，而是“我的世界”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 人生没有捷径，即使走了捷径，你也会加倍还回来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a> 大部分考研可能都是在走弯路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> 30岁+，职业发展遇到瓶颈，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">49:28</a> 野生求职法：投简历其实是最不靠谱的找工作办法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> 摆脱受害者心态：做一场“自我全责”的思想实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3432">57:12</a> 小公司和大公司怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3646">1:00:46</a> 什么样的领导算是好领导？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3797">1:03:17</a> 女性应该如何面对职场性别歧视？</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜推荐阅读｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>古典《拆掉思维里的墙》《跃迁》</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢丽尔·桑德伯格《向前一步》</span></p><span></span><p><span>梅耶·马斯克《人生由我》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期配乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>五月天《倔强》</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作团队｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容策划/后期制作：Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜关注我们｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lponX6KoIqDD5Ajb7s6i2iv1jO7r.m4a" length="134867430" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqRW5DaW9pQjhtNzZWc1NVOF9NS3NrVU1MYUEucG5n.png"/>
