    <title>014.河森堡×梁秋阳：辩论是社恐的归宿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6184d3e9963ea898a164b2b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6184d3e9963ea898a164b2b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Nov 2021 06:49:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“有价值的观点一定有可能错，不会错的观点没有价值。”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梁秋阳，《奇葩说》辩手</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 讲解员和辩手的废话文学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 辩论是社恐的归宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 好看的人就别来玩儿辩论了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 得出共识or分出胜负，哪个更重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 语言有时比现实世界更真实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 辩论让我不孤独，因为我脑海里永远至少有两个声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 追问意义这件事有意义吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> 我没办法不在意别人的评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 在网上讲话真的太难了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 虽然每天都很焦虑，但也算过得下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 来吧，宽慰我吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> （回答问题环节）关于说服与沟通的超级干货</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期配乐｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：美好vlog - I-zony</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：建议是看开点 - 椅子乐团</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容策划/后期制作：Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜关注我们｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></p>]]></description>
