  <item>
    <title>013.河森堡×陨石猎人俞斌：我在地球捡星星（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/617141d5a77af4701b0e29ff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">617141d5a77af4701b0e29ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Oct 2021 10:32:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是“河森堡的有趣人类展厅”系列直播的音频纯享版，视频版请在视频号“河森堡爱读书”观看。</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>俞斌，陨石收藏家，国际陨石猎人，国际陨石收藏家协会会员IMCA#5192，国际陨石与行星科学学会会员，4.5Billion星际实验室创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 面对突如其来的巨额财富，人性经得住考验吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 中国有哪些著名的陨石？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fnd1BEAHWymncm7w1B_qkugNl_RE.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>吉林一号陨石 目前世界上最大的石陨石 // 现收藏于吉林博物馆</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fju4zpr6L8kbD5Evng7AuNv_qzOC.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>西双版纳曼桂陨石 “儿童节的礼物” // 现收藏于上海天文馆</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 陨石在藏传佛教中的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 最新发现的未命名铁陨石</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fk433wsLcCojVPys7a0IndsxhWb5.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>（陨石正面的韦德曼交纹）</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FhwdAp1xBheKbw1XfnOwOY62_6H9.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>（陨石皮壳）</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> 车里雅宾斯克陨石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a> 陨石掉在地上不烫手吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 这么大的地方，怎么找到这么小的陨石呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a> 陨石为什么大多数都在无人区？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 新疆阜康石铁橄榄陨石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 陨石加工技术以及陨石相关的文创产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> 怎么样才能成为一个陨石猎人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 我们的征途是星辰大海</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期配乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>宇宙宁静 - Kaleidoscopic Univrse</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作团队｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容策划/后期制作：Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜关注我们｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></p>]]></description>
