    <guid isPermaLink="false">616ce727d8fa23fb00fc4dcf</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Oct 2021 03:16:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>“陨石是太空送给我们唯一的礼物”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>俞斌，陨石收藏家，国际陨石猎人，国际陨石收藏家协会会员IMCA#5192，国际陨石与行星科学学会会员，4.5Billion星际实验室创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 什么是陨石，什么是陨石猎人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 陨石有辐射吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 陨石猎人会遇到什么样的危险？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 怎样可以成为陨石猎人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 陨石有哪些分类？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 陨石为何能测算地球年龄？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> 陨石值不值钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 怎么知道陨石来自哪个星球？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 哪些地方更有可能找到陨石？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 怎么样判断一块石头是不是陨石？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">40:06</a> 为什么研究陨石这么重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜建议配图收听｜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvurNtL3qeTnM2MRnNK1_raiURbW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆石铁橄榄陨石（发现陨石） ｜俄罗斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FjundHSCsj_cB-I1OwjQfp9exw1x.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆月球陨石</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FhhTTWSq8vpmyn_Du22-ZTuFLQrg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆火星陨石</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FoHCNeAOB2Il57mDFza94kTWXRpV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆玻璃陨石 &nbsp;雷公墨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FhhRMUKLAXGU4esFwG3zqo0lIrl1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆铁陨石表面的韦德曼交纹</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作团队｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容策划/后期制作：Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜关注我们｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></p>]]></description>
