  <item>
    <title>011.河森堡×李淼：普通人为何会堕落成恶魔</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6146ace3233a4dd53f55a34d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6146ace3233a4dd53f55a34d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Sep 2021 03:22:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“世界的光明和温暖是存在的，但阴暗和危险是不可能消失的。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>李淼李三水，罪案作家</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期书目｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>《李淼罪案故事》第一卷 如坠深渊</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> 为什么要写真实罪案故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 社会文化环境对犯罪的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 中日有哪些文化差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 争论与说服他人真的有用吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a> 聊聊内心的恐惧：小时候怕鬼，长大后怕人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 为什么我们会喜欢恐怖故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 北九州案件：生死面前人性和亲情都经不住考验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2263">37:43</a> 哪些因素会让一个人堕落成一个罪犯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 人是否会上当受骗不在于宗教信仰，而在于内心的贪念</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期音乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>高梨康治 - 地狱の川流れ</span></p><span></span><p><span>71 - 地 獄 流</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作团队｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容策划/后期制作：Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜关注我们｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></p>]]></description>
