    <title>005.如果今年只读一本文学书，建议你选朱西甯的《铁浆》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60fffdb9a69ada167c1b2efa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60fffdb9a69ada167c1b2efa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jul 2021 12:04:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>“最后一位民国小说家”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“我们对朱西甯的了解，迟到了四五十年。”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>｜本期书目｜</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《铁浆》朱西甯</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 朱西甯是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 铁浆的故事（部分剧透）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 铁浆原文中的精彩描写</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="977">16:17</a> 朱西甯与白先勇文字的共同特点：极度克制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 清末北京城“斗狠”的江湖故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> 朱西甯的生平经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 朱西甯对人性的拿捏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 宏大叙事与微观视角的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> （题外话）河南暴雨：中华文明本就起源于一场对洪水的抗争，可以说，从历史的源头开始，这片土地上的人们就被这种灾难面前舍身忘死守望相助的精神照耀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期音乐｜</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>片头：好汉歌（唢呐）- 浑元Rysn</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>插曲：五虎封将 - 黎允文</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>片尾：巴赫G大调第一提琴组曲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>｜本期主播｜</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>河森堡（@河森堡）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>｜制作团队｜</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>logo设计：阿不思</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后期制作：Ronan</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>｜关注我们｜</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>微博@河森堡 @河森堡爱读书</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号@河森堡爱读书</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信视频号@河森堡爱读书</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>B站@讲解员河森堡</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
