  <item>
    <title>004.我控制不住脑子里那些疯狂的想法啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60f93d075a259c96043aeb0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60f93d075a259c96043aeb0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Jul 2021 09:22:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>｜本期书目｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>《人体简史》比尔·布莱森</span></p><span></span><p><span>《人间烟火》赵冬梅</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期剧透｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 对死亡的恐惧是与生俱来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 象征不死的符号往往出现在棺材与陵墓中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 你愿意牺牲快乐来换取可能的长寿吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 父母是你与死神之间的最后一道墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 端粒：你身体内的死亡进度条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 衰老是进化出来的一种生命现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 一个普通人离去后被遗忘的速度可能超过你的想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 那些英雄人物的至暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 理论上每年我们都会过一次自己的祭日，只不过死之前没人知道它会在哪一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1378">22:58</a> 我控制不住我脑子里的可怕想法啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 不是你想吃零食，是你肠道里的微生物想吃！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 成全自己vs成全别人的期待，两者产生矛盾时应该如何选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2311">38:31</a> 为什么近几十年来，年轻一辈与父母之间的冲突越来越加剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期音乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：巴赫G大调第一提琴组曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：中岛美嘉 - 曾经我也想过一了百了；削除 - Dead</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：SecSound - 有灯也有人</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期主播｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>河森堡（@河森堡）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ronan（@是Ronan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作团队｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计：阿不思</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：阿不思（@麻雀致作）</span></p><span>